<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Detailed results on ChartMimic</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the complete results on ChartMimic <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib51" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al., 2025b</a>)</cite> in Table <a href="#A5.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ E.2 Detailed results on ChartMimic ‣ Appendix E Detailed Experimental Results ‣ JanusCoder: Towards a Foundational Visual-Programmatic Interface for Code Intelligence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> and Table <a href="#A5.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ E.2 Detailed results on ChartMimic ‣ Appendix E Detailed Experimental Results ‣ JanusCoder: Towards a Foundational Visual-Programmatic Interface for Code Intelligence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> for direct mimic and customized mimic, respectively.</p>
</div>
