<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Detailed Analysis and Comparisons</h2>

<section id="A6.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.1 </span>General Coding Capabilities</h3>

<div id="A6.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">More experiments on balancing visualization capability and general coding capabilities are in Figure <a href="#A6.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ F.1 General Coding Capabilities ‣ Appendix F Detailed Analysis and Comparisons ‣ JanusCoder: Towards a Foundational Visual-Programmatic Interface for Code Intelligence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
