</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Case Studies</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present some case studies of generated UIs and artifacts, as shown in Figure <a href="#A7.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix G Case Studies ‣ JanusCoder: Towards a Foundational Visual-Programmatic Interface for Code Intelligence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, Figure <a href="#A7.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix G Case Studies ‣ JanusCoder: Towards a Foundational Visual-Programmatic Interface for Code Intelligence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, and Figure <a href="#A7.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix G Case Studies ‣ JanusCoder: Towards a Foundational Visual-Programmatic Interface for Code Intelligence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.23538v1/cases-interactscience.png" id="A7.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/347;" width="548" height="347" alt="Refer to caption">
